    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Object property generated from foreign key 'rental.inventory_id' referencing 'inventory.inventory_id'.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a rental to the single inventory item (physical film copy) that was rented. Mandatory; derived from foreign key rental.inventory_id referencing inventory.inventory_id.</rdfs:comment>
