    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An employee of the rental business who processes rentals. Each staff member is assigned to exactly one store and has exactly one postal address. A staff member may manage a store through store.manager_staff_id. Each staff member is uniquely identified by staff_id.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A staff member (employee) of the rental business. Referenced by store.manager_staff_id as the manager of a store.</rdfs:comment>
