    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Object property generated from foreign key 'film_category.film_id' referencing 'film.film_id'.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a film-category assignment to the film being categorized. Derived from the non-null foreign key film_category.film_id, which references film.film_id. This property is part of the composite primary key of film_category. Each assignment refers to exactly one film.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
