    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Identifier of the film whose textual information (title and description) is recorded. Primary key of table film_text; mandatory, so every FilmText individual has exactly one film id. It is an opaque identifier, not a categorical or ordinal encoding. Derived from column film_text.film_id (xsd:integer).</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology#film_category_last_update">
