    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Data property generated from source column 'city.city_id' with range xsd:integer.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Surrogate primary-key identifier of a city (column city.city_id, xsd:integer, not null, primary key). It is an opaque identifier, not a categorical or ordinal code. Each city has exactly one value, and it serves as the key of the City class.</rdfs:comment>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/provenance/city/city_id"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
